### Send request with dynamic variables in request's body
POST https://tracks.test/api/tracks
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest
Accept: application/json

{
    "southWest": {
        "lat": 53.735447,
        "lng": 9.083513
    },
    "northEast": {
        "lat": 55.124468,
        "lng": 14.083032
    },
    "zoom": 8,
    "year": 2026
}

